ose your path through randomly generated memories of the town you used to live.<br>Stat checks for things like athletic ability and strength unfold into build choices beyond DPS.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2084330/extras/092c73c2acf962f69c9011e56165509d.webp?t=1725005801\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2084330/extras/ba06918ce0348971f5a589f1bb4b3d65.poster.avif?t=1725005801\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2084330/extras/ba06918ce0348971f5a589f1bb4b3d65.webm?t=1725005801\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2084330/extras/ba06918ce0348971f5a589f1bb4b3d65.mp4?t=1725005801\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Physically push doors open, peak angles with wrist holding.<br>Anything you can hold, you can physically slap enemies with. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2084330/extras/d1e95c299402ff1bda83944fcdaaa448.webp?t=1725005801\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2084330/extras/cfd64c87e4e261d4b5521e74bb8ff310.poster.avif?t=1725005801\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2084330/extras/cfd64c87e4e261d4b5521e74bb8ff310.webm?t=1725005801\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2084330/extras/cfd64c87e4e261d4b5521e74bb8ff310.mp4?t=1725005801\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>No decal count limits here, paint entire levels in the blood and bile of your enemies.<b